# MedLead — Patient Inquiry CRM

A full-stack patient inquiry and lead management platform built to help healthcare teams manage international patient inquiries, assign leads, track treatment journeys, and maintain follow-up activity.

<p align="center">
  <a href="https://medlead.vercel.app/"><strong>Live Demo</strong></a> ·
  <a href="https://github.com/shubhhh009/medlead"><strong>GitHub Repository</strong></a>
</p>

## Overview

MedLead centralizes patient inquiries in a CRM workflow. Administrators can manage incoming leads, assign them to tele-callers, monitor lead statuses, and review notes and activity history.

## Key Features

- **Patient Inquiry Form:** Collect patient contact details, country, treatment preferences, preferred city, and inquiry descriptions.
- **Lead Management:** Search, filter, and paginate patient inquiries.
- **Lead Status Workflow:** Track leads from New through Contacted, Reports Received, Quotation Sent, Travel Planned, Converted, or Lost.
- **Role-Based Access Control:** Separate Admin and Tele-caller permissions.
- **Lead Assignment:** Assign patient inquiries to tele-callers.
- **Notes and Activity Timeline:** Maintain notes and track lead-related updates.
- **Dashboard:** Review lead statistics and team information.
- **Authentication:** Login/logout with JWT-based authentication and password hashing.
- **Duplicate Prevention:** Detect duplicate inquiries using email or phone information.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technologies |
|---|---|
| Frontend | Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | Next.js API Routes |
| Database | PostgreSQL with Supabase |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Authentication | jose, JWT, bcryptjs |
| Deployment | Vercel |
| Version Control | Git, GitHub |

